#NEXUS

[ zanno2009a_fig2: Coelurosaur summary ladder, fully resolved, read from a 2x crop. Coelurosauria and Paraves, printed beside node dots, are kept as internal labels; the patterned dots at the other two nodes carry no name. The arrows and boxes at the right mark character changes, not branches. 11 tips, fully resolved; 2 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 4 case (census 2, seed 20261201). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=11;
    TAXLABELS
        Allosauroidea
        Compsognathidae
        Tyrannosauroidea
        Ornithomimosauria
        Ornitholestes
        Therizinosauria
        Alvarezsauridae
        Oviraptorosauria
        Avialae
        Troodontidae
        Dromaeosauridae
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE zanno2009a_fig2 = [&R] (Allosauroidea,((Compsognathidae,Tyrannosauroidea),(Ornithomimosauria,(Ornitholestes,(Therizinosauria,(Alvarezsauridae,(Oviraptorosauria,(Avialae,(Troodontidae,Dromaeosauridae))Paraves))))))Coelurosauria);
END;
